<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>This Hurts</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">Mindless Self Indulgence</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">PINK</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">2tmNeNQdDacFBFMTNfTqDz</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:00.320" end="00:02.020">Night falls</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:02.020" end="00:03.520">In the dream</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:03.480" end="00:05.270">You are falling</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:05.270" end="00:11.540">As dark lightens</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:11.540" end="00:15.460" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(So... Much... Blood...)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:15.460" end="00:16.960">Oh! Uh-oh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:16.850" end="00:18.350">Oh! Uh-oh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:18.350" end="00:20.900">Oh! Uh-oh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:20.900" end="00:23.160">Yeah, yeah!</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:23.160" end="00:24.910">Oh God, I'm beautiful</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:24.910" end="00:26.770">Oh God, I'm wonderful</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:26.770" end="00:28.430">I'm marvelous, intelligent</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:28.430" end="00:31.380">So why doesn't that make me feel better?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:31.380" end="00:32.880">I need some more</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:32.510" end="00:34.340">I need someone who's insecure</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:34.340" end="00:36.220">I don't care who you are</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:36.220" end="00:38.210" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Controlling you makes me better!)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:38.210" end="00:41.860">(Oh!) This hurts me more than</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:41.860" end="00:45.860">(Oh!) It will ever hurt you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:45.860" end="00:49.750">(Oh!) This hurts me more than</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:49.750" end="00:53.410">(Oh!) It will ever hurt</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:53.410" end="00:55.570">You</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:55.570" end="01:01.020" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(I struck her face until it ran blood)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:01.020" end="01:05.290">This will hurt you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:05.290" end="01:07.130">This will help me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:07.130" end="01:09.520">Help me hurt you!</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:09.520" end="01:11.020">Oh! Uh-oh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:10.770" end="01:12.790">Oh! Uh-oh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:12.790" end="01:14.410">Oh! Uh-oh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:14.410" end="01:16.410">Yeah, yeah!</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:16.410" end="01:18.520">Oh God, I can't exist</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:18.520" end="01:20.220">I need someone meaningless</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:20.220" end="01:22.100">To justify my existence</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:22.100" end="01:24.890">Fucking you will keep me alive</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:24.890" end="01:26.390">But it never does</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:26.260" end="01:28.060">And that's the way it always was</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:28.060" end="01:30.040">Lovely ladies, maids of honor</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:30.040" end="01:32.110" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Fucking you will make me stronger!)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:32.110" end="01:35.970">(Oh!) This hurts me more than</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:35.970" end="01:39.610">(Oh!) It will ever hurt you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:39.610" end="01:43.720">(Oh!) This hurts me more than</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:43.720" end="01:45.540">(Oh!) It will</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:45.540" end="01:49.940" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Oh!)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:49.940" end="01:51.510">This will help me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:51.510" end="01:53.350">Help me hurt you!</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:53.350" end="01:54.850">Oh God, I'm beautiful</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:54.280" end="01:55.780">Oh God, I'm wonderful</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:55.030" end="01:56.530">I'm marvelous, intelligent</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:55.860" end="01:57.360">So why doesn't that make me feel better?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:57.350" end="02:01.290" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Fucking you will make me stronger!)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:01.290" end="02:04.720">This will help me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:04.720" end="02:07.960">This will hurt you... (This hurts me more than...)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:07.960" end="02:12.670" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Fucking you will make me stronger!)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:12.670" end="02:14.250">This will help me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:14.250" end="02:16.260">Help me hurt you!</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:16.260" end="02:18.900" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Hurt me!)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:18.900" end="02:22.900" /></div></body></tt>